# Traffic Sign Dataset

This dataset is generated using Python for CNN-based traffic sign classification.

## Dataset Classes

1. STOP
2. NO ENTRY
3. GIVE WAY
4. TURN LEFT

## Dataset Specifications

- Image format: BMP
- Image resolution: 32 x 32 pixels
- Color: RGB
- Total images: 4,000

## Dataset Distribution

| Split | Images per Class |
|---|---:|
| Training | 800 |
| Validation | 100 |
| Testing | 100 |

The dataset is synthetically generated using Python.
